{"availability":"available","full":"Alhol18/claude-code-operating-system","name":"claude-code-operating-system","description":"How I run a small e-commerce business with Claude Code: instruction file, model routing, hooks, a skill and tools.","category":"Business","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-10T08:20:34Z","updated":"2026-10-10T16:25:33Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://holovko-ai.pages.dev","topics":["ai-agents","automation","claude-code"],"demo":"https://holovko-ai.pages.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:50.802Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:50.802Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T17:58:50.802Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T19:04:04.846Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T17:58:50.802Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is how I run a small e-commerce business with Claude Code as the daily operator.","I own the brand and for years did almost every job in it by hand: orders, shipping, bookkeeping, support, content, ads. Over the past year I rebuilt those jobs as processes that an agent runs and I approve. This repository is the brand-neutral extract of that setup: the instruction file the agent reads at the start of every session, the rules for choosing a model, the hooks, one skill, and a few tools.","The working repositories stay private. They hold customer data, finances and the brand voice. Everything here is taken from them, translated to English and cleaned of names, business figures and keys."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Alhol18/claude-code-operating-system/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8ecec0c0c4a3d48133a2de1d501f26a11b343da3eb6c99f01685fa2f8e7df2f5","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T19:04:04.939Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:04:04.939Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is how I run a small e-commerce business with Claude Code as the dail